                                "sense_id": "b28b848a-08bf-3ceb-97df-a37bc8bb61cf",
                                "text": "My dear Mademoiselle, perhaps you have already observed that in Casablanca, human life is cheap. Good night, Mademoiselle."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
